"""
Hotel vendor matching on rows_overlap  (car-rental pipeline ka hotel version)

Flow:
  CELL 1  config + bedrock client + call counter
  CELL 2  normalization + brand table
  CELL 3  brute force layer  -> "yes" / "no" / "unsure"
  CELL 4  LLM layer (only for "unsure")
  CELL 5  DRY RUN  -> exact LLM call count BEFORE spending anything
  CELL 6  resolve unique pairs (tqdm + live counter)
  CELL 7  apply back to r1 -> rows_vendor
"""

